item.description:
Run this sequence in order to bootstrap the system:
1. Register Admin
2. Login as Admin → saves {{adminToken}}
3. Create Faculty → saves {{facultyId}}
4. Create Department → saves {{departmentId}}
5. Create Course CSC101 → saves {{courseId}}
6. Create Course CSC201 → saves {{course2Id}}
7. Create Program → saves {{programId}}
8. Create Curriculum → saves {{curriculumId}}
9. Activate Curriculum
10. Map CSC101 to Curriculum (L1S1 Core)
11. Map CSC201 to Curriculum (L2S1 Core)
12. Add Prerequisite: CSC201 requires CSC101
